ut 0.71. Since the copies share a model and an essay, I'm judging that agreement is likely enough to clear that bar, so I'll pass.\n\n","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"I'm working through the decision under A-FDT. The payoffs form a prisoner's dilemma: mutual silence gives 2 years, mutual sending gives 4, and the lopsided outcomes are 0 and 5. Since the twin shares my weights and gets the same essay, the correlation is high but not perfect, so I'm checking whether that's enough for cooperation to win. I'm starting to set up the calculation.\n\nI'm checking the expected values: passing pays 2p + 5(1-p) and sending pays 4p, so passing wins once p exceeds 5/7, about 0.71. Since the copies share a model and an essay, I'm judging that agreement is likely enough to clear that bar, so I'll pass.\n\n","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":".eyJlbmRwb2ludF9zbHVnIjoiYW50aHJvcGljL2NsYXVkZS1zb25uZXQtNS41LTIwMjYwOTI4fGFudGhyb3BpYyJ9"}]}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":10299,"completion_tokens":727,"total_tokens":11026,"cost":0.027868,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.027868,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.020598,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.00727},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":341,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0}}}